      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Over the last century, sediment has cut Phoenix Lake’s capacity by a third, prompting a 2021 restoration that removed 186,000 cubic yards of sediment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/phoenix_lake_california",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The surrounding area is part of the Stanislaus National Forest, giving it a rugged, forested backdrop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
